<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>The macro for the game «Locked» in Roblox performs a series of sequential actions: First, he throws the ball into the air, then dribbling the ball in motion. At the same time, mistakes are possible, especially if you have a high ping. It is recommended to set 800 DPI and 171 sensitivity in Roblox. The 1920 x 1080 resolution is considered convenient, but you can use any other one, since mouse movement is based on relative coordinates. Be attentive to the settings!</Description>
